WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.708
Four numbers summarize the paper's impact.

00:00:02.788 --> 00:00:09.015
The model achieves a seventy-seven point four nine
percent VQA score on GQA-REX and seventy-one

00:00:09.095 --> 00:00:11.272
point four eight percent on VQA-E,

00:00:11.352 --> 00:00:13.330
both at state-of-the-art level.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:14.591
In the human study,

00:00:14.671 --> 00:00:20.433
sixty-five point one six percent of the generated
explanations were judged by annotators

00:00:20.513 --> 00:00:23.221
to genuinely lead to the predicted answer.

00:00:23.301 --> 00:00:26.474
And in roughly sixty point five percent of cases,

00:00:26.554 --> 00:00:32.050
the model both predicts the correct answer and
generates a valid explanation for it.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:37.759
The human study itself was substantial: four
thousand seven hundred thirty-five unique

00:00:37.839 --> 00:00:41.145
image-question pairs from the VQA-E validation set,

00:00:41.225 --> 00:00:43.203
each rated by three annotators,

00:00:43.283 --> 00:00:47.850
for over fourteen thousand responses from one
hundred eleven subjects.
